          <div class="detail-panel p-3.5 mt-2.5 border border-solid border-line rounded-[7px] bg-panel [&>h2]:mb-3 [&>p]:mb-3 [&>p]:text-[.8rem]"><h2>Achievements</h2><p class="muted text-muted">Every milestone leads to another. Keep climbing to unlock higher targets.</p><ul class="achievement-list list-none p-0 m-0 [&_li]:flex [&_li]:items-center [&_li]:gap-3 [&_li]:px-0 [&_li]:py-3.5 [&_li]:border-t [&_li]:border-solid [&_li]:border-t-line [&_svg]:w-6 [&_svg]:shrink-0 [&_svg]:text-accent [&_li_>_div]:flex-1 [&_li_>_div]:min-w-0 [&_p]:mx-0 [&_p]:mb-0 [&_p]:mt-1 [&_progress]:w-full [&_progress]:h-2 [&_progress]:mt-2 [&_progress]:accent-accent"><li v-for="item in adventureProgress.achievements" :key="item.id"><AppIcon :name="item.unlocked ? 'check' : 'mountain'" /><div><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong><p class="muted text-muted">{{ item.description }}</p><template v-if="!item.unlocked"><progress :value="item.current" :max="item.target" :aria-label="`${item.name} progress`" /><p class="muted text-muted">{{ item.current.toLocaleString() }} / {{ item.target.toLocaleString() }}</p></template></div><span class="badge inline-block px-1.5 py-0.75 text-muted bg-bg border border-solid border-line rounded-[3px] text-[.66rem] font-medium whitespace-nowrap [&.topped]:text-success [&.topped]:bg-success-soft" :class="{ topped: item.unlocked }">{{ item.unlocked ? 'Unlocked' : 'Locked' }}</span></li></ul></div>
          <div class="detail-panel p-3.5 mt-2.5 border border-solid border-line rounded-[7px] bg-panel [&>h2]:mb-3 [&>p]:mb-3 [&>p]:text-[.8rem]"><h2>How XP works</h2><p class="muted text-muted">New sends logged here earn 100 XP for Redpoint, 125 for Flash, or 150 for Onsight. Each route counts once. Unsend removes its reward. Attempts and grade votes earn no XP.</p><p class="muted text-muted">Progress belongs to this account across all gyms, on this device only. Clearing offline data and signing out keep your adventure.</p><button class="danger full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-[4px] text-[.82rem] font-semibold border border-solid border-line text-error bg-surface mt-4 w-full" :disabled="state.ascentBusy" @click="resetAdventure">Reset adventure progress</button></div>
